{"id": "q0033", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 425375537, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "Dominick went to his team's changing room and saw half as many robots as helmets and half as many helmets as footballs kept there. If there were 20 helmets, calculate the total number of items Dominick saw.\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0033.wav", "input_sha256": "c164aa67533d3436c71dbb71b12554e38945f5cdb8aa47bd1a8c9c0f79cf92e8", "input_samples": 265800, "input_s": 16.613, "n_real_chunks": 17, "score": 0.3417, "act": 0.9945, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Robots = half as many as helmets = 20 ÷ 2 = 10 Helmets = 20 Helmets are half as many as footballs, so footballs = 20 × 2 = 40 Total items = robots + helmets + footballs Total = 10 + 20 + 40 = 70 Final numeric answer: 70", "expert_answer": "Robots = half as many as helmets = 20 ÷ 2 = 10  \nHelmets = 20  \nHelmets are half as many as footballs, so footballs = 20 × 2 = 40  \n\nTotal items = robots + helmets + footballs  \nTotal = 10 + 20 + 40 = **70**\n\nFinal numeric answer: **70**", "transcript": "Dominic went to his team's changing room and saw half as many robots as helmets and half as many helmets as footballs kept there. If there were 20 helmets, calculate the total number of items Dominic saw. Show your work and end with the final numeric answer.\n", "asr_s": 1.26, "expert_s": 2.51, "expert_input_samples": 265800, "expert_input_s": 16.613, "expert_input_sha256": "c164aa67533d3436c71dbb71b12554e38945f5cdb8aa47bd1a8c9c0f79cf92e8", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 2.521, "relay_synth_ms"