{"id": "q0047", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1366746607, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "The Kennel house keeps 3 German Shepherds and 2 Bulldogs. If a German Shepherd consumes 5 kilograms of dog food and a bulldog consumes 3 kilograms of dog food per day. How many kilograms of dog food will they need in a week?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0047.wav", "input_sha256": "a48b173194ec7cdd3b6504499222ad387bd8d221ba0234984d75a31a6fcec633", "input_samples": 292200, "input_s": 18.262, "n_real_chunks": 19, "score": 0.1441, "act": 0.9983, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "German Shepherds: 3 × 5 = 15 kg per day Bulldogs: 2 × 3 = 6 kg per day Total per day: 15 + 6 = 21 kg For one week: 21 × 7 = 147 kg Final numeric answer: 147", "expert_answer": "German Shepherds:  \n3 × 5 = 15 kg per day\n\nBulldogs:  \n2 × 3 = 6 kg per day\n\nTotal per day:  \n15 + 6 = 21 kg\n\nFor one week:  \n21 × 7 = 147 kg\n\n**Final numeric answer: 147**", "transcript": "The kennel house keeps three German Shepherds and two bulldogs. If a German Shepherd consumes 5 kilograms of dog food and a bulldog consumes 3 kilograms of dog food per day, how many kilograms of dog food will they need in a week? Show your work and end with the final numeric answer.\n", "asr_s": 1.27, "expert_s": 11.17, "expert_input_samples": 292200, "expert_input_s": 18.262, "expert_input_sha256": "a48b173194ec7cdd3b6504499222ad387bd8d221ba0234984d75a31a6fcec633", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 11.339, "relay_synth_ms": 13597, "onset_chunk": 18, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_la