{"id": "q0069", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2230889066, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "Every day Charisma meditates for 15 minutes when she first wakes up and again before she goes to sleep.  5 days a week she practices 1 hour of yoga.  in 4 weeks, how much time has she spent on meditation/yoga practice?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0069.wav", "input_sha256": "2ff180e10298b8c8113ff7403578312d58d33ac418339ccb4e0837230683d338", "input_samples": 279600, "input_s": 17.475, "n_real_chunks": 18, "score": 0.3248, "act": 0.9986, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Meditation: 15 minutes when she wakes up + 15 minutes before sleep = 30 minutes/day , 4 weeks = 28 days , 30 × 28 = 840 minutes , 840 ÷ 60 = 14 hours Yoga: 1 hour/day × 5 days/week = 5 hours/week , 5 × 4 weeks = 20 hours Total: 14 hours meditation + 20 hours yoga = 34 hours Final numeric answer: 34 hours", "expert_answer": "Meditation:\n\n- 15 minutes when she wakes up + 15 minutes before sleep = **30 minutes/day**\n- 4 weeks = 28 days\n- 30 × 28 = **840 minutes**\n- 840 ÷ 60 = **14 hours**\n\nYoga:\n\n- 1 hour/day × 5 days/week = **5 hours/week**\n- 5 × 4 weeks = **20 hours**\n\nTotal:\n\n- 14 hours meditation + 20 hours yoga = **34 hours**\n\n**Final numeric answer: 34 hours**", "transcript": "Every day, Charisma meditates for 15 minutes when she first wakes up and again before she goes to sleep. Five days a week, she practices one hour of yoga. In four weeks, how much time has she spent on meditation slash yoga practice? Show your work and end with the final numeric answer.\n"