{"id": "q0101", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3720081385, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "Riproarin' Ringo was roping a recalcitrant dogie. Ringo decided to give the dogie a reprieve by calculating \\[|(1-i)^8|\\]before riding after the dogie. What answer should Ringo have found?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0101.wav", "input_sha256": "1ec9e7f5f9ada392c830d2d5b2f748a327a5dac43cbc6c5604f062faa0a5104d", "input_samples": 222000, "input_s": 13.875, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.8173, "act": 0.9981, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "1 “one I eight” is likely \\(1i^8\\), where \\(i\\) is the imaginary unit. \\[ i^8 = (i^4)^2 = 1^2 = 1 \\] Final answer: 1", "expert_answer": "**1**\n\n“one I eight” is likely **\\(1i^8\\)**, where \\(i\\) is the imaginary unit.\n\n\\[\ni^8 = (i^4)^2 = 1^2 = 1\n\\]\n\nFinal answer: **1**", "transcript": "Ripuarian Ringo was roping a recalcitrant doggie. Ringo decided to give the doggie a reprieve by calculating one I eight before riding after the doggie. What answer should Ringo have found? Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 0.88, "expert_s": 9.66, "expert_input_samples": 222000, "expert_input_s": 13.875, "expert_input_sha256": "1ec9e7f5f9ada392c830d2d5b2f748a327a5dac43cbc6c5604f062faa0a5104d", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 7.041, "relay_synth_ms": 28440, "onset_chunk": 14, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 2, "feed_lag_max_ms": 1537, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 2805, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0101_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "364829426595e0420949a84577091dfed326611b0736