{"id": "q0117", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 767785885, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "Let $z = 2 + \\sqrt{2} - (3 + 3 \\sqrt{2})i$, and let $c = 2 - 3i$.  Let $w$ be the result when $z$ is rotated around $c$ by $\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ counter-clockwise.\n\n[asy]\nunitsize(0.6 cm);\n\npair C, W, Z;\n\nZ = (2 + sqrt(2), -3 - 3*sqrt(2));\nC = (2,-3);\nW = rotate(45,C)*(Z);\n\ndraw(Z--C--W);\n\ndot(\"$c$\", C, N);\ndot(\"$w$\", W, SE);\ndot(\"$z$\", Z, S);\nlabel(\"$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$\", C + (0.6,-1));\n[/asy]\n\nFind $w.$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0117.wav", "input_sha256": "a4ec9baee8bdbfc79d9150b0c10f81b383e91953897fdfc2f63c8d540224ffc9", "input_samples": 451600, "input_s": 28.225, "n_real_chunks": 29, "score": 0.9537, "act": 0.9934, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "\\[ w=c+e^{i\\pi/4}(z-c) \\] Given \\[ z=(2+\\sqrt2)-(3+3\\sqrt2)i,\\qquad c=2-3i \\] Then \\[ z-c=\\sqrt2-3\\sqrt2 i=\\sqrt2(1-3i) \\] and \\[ e^{i\\pi/4}=\\frac{1+i}{\\sqrt2} \\] So \\[ e^{i\\pi/4}(z-c)=\\frac{1+i}{\\sqrt2}\\cdot \\sqrt2(1-3i) \\] \\[ =(1+i)(1-3i)=4-2i \\] Therefore \\[ w=c+(4-2i)=(2-3i)+(4-2i)=6-5i \\] \\[ \\boxed{w=6-5i} \\]", "expert_answer": "\\[\nw=c+e^{i\\pi/4}(z-c)\n\\]\n\nGiven\n\n\\[\nz=(2+\\sqrt2)-(3+3\\sqrt2)i,\\qquad c=2-3i\n\\]\n\nThen\n\n\\[\nz-c=\\sqrt2-3\\sqrt2 i=\\sqrt2(1-3i)\n\\]\n\nand\n\n\\[\ne^{i\\pi/4}=\\frac{1+i}{\\sqrt2}\n\\]\n\nSo\n\n\\[\ne^{i\\pi/4}(z-c)=\\frac{1+i}{\\sqrt2}\\cdot \\sqrt2(1-3i)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=(1+i)(1-3i)=4-2i\n\\]\n\nTherefore\n\n\\[\nw=c+(4-2i)=(2-3i)+(4-2i)=6-5i\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{w=6-5i}\n\\]", "transcript": "Let z equals 2 plus square root 2 minus 3 plus 3, and let c equals 2 minus 3i. Let w be the result when z is rotated around c by pi frac counterclockwise. Assume unit size 0.6 centimeters. Pair c, w, z. z equals 2 plus square root 2 minus 3 minus 3 square root 2. c equals 2 minus 3. w equals rotate ", "asr_s": 2.41, "expert_s": 5.46, "expert_input_samples": 451600, "expert_input_s": 28.225, "expert_input_sha256": "a4ec9baee8bdbfc79d9150b0c10f81b383e91953897fdfc2f63c8d540224ffc9", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 6.279, "relay_synth_ms": 131880, "onset_chunk": 28, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 411, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 411, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0117_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "1a179671ec5bf3bb25f3a724374d36a922861a62f557445df2af8917bda3931c", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 236.96}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0117_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "c9c289dbaadbe04db48a60f3d52b2b7d63f6991472a2dc4dec94caeb842bab42", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0117_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "e6c8c2f46f9927e82b4245b122433cfb60efb8f65720fd0c0a3b4e677050fd06", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.078, 1.143, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.083, 2.15, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.083, 3.148, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.083, 4.151, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.085, 5.155, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.084, 6.153, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.083, 7.151, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.086, 8.154, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.082, 9.15, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.082, 10.146, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.083, 11.148, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.084, 12.151, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.092, 13.166, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.087, 14.155, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.084, 15.15, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.091, 16.161, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.086, 17.152, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.085, 18.15, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.086, 19.152, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.086, 20.152, 1, 0, 0]